 deltaBasis:'Delta binding review of R6-POLICY-5, the runtime author\'s answer to round 8 (ssctr-dossier/REVISION_R6_POLICY_5.md, author material). Structured diff against the reviewed bytes (ssctr-dossier/PROGRAM_POLICY_R6.reviewed-1046ad0e.json): revision label and revisionNote; changed strength.setIncreaseAtBlockBoundary, strength.loggedLoadAdoption.semantics (D48 clause), event.raceDayCompletion.semantics, return.reasonScreen (R11 sentence) and learning.missingGate (R12, R13); added event.raceDayCompletion.historyModes [WALK_JOG, RESTART], return.strengthReturnSets, return.returnLoadCap and return.restartRunHistory. No numeric value changed or was added; no envelope magnitude is widened. Runtime diff against the byte-identical round-8 copy (ssctr-dossier/reviewed-1046ad0e-source, verified against the file hashes recorded in round 8): r6-program advanceRun, plannedOf, projectionGates, withModeHistory, projectWeeks, strengthDose, returnStepSets, startStrengthReturn, advanceStrength, strengthRowsFor, raceDayCompletionBasis, raceDayCompletion, eventCompletionItem, generateProgram; r6-adaptation finishProposal, returnAfterPause; r6-prescription exerciseRow; r6-clinical lexicon and joinCompounds; tests r6-ssctr-r8-fixes (new) and one D48 assertion in r6-ssctr-r7-fixes. Four Europe PMC searches; four new full texts (R6-S44 to R6-S47).',
